{"material_id": "ntce.chuzhong.lishi.2018a.q25.material.recovered", "text": "材料一：中国人民不是倒向社会主义一边，就是倒向帝国主义一边，绝无例外。骑墙是不行的，第三条道路是没有的。——摘编自毛泽东《论人民民主专政》材料二：从1960至1964年，共有14个亚非国家同中国正式建交，其中撒哈拉以南的独立的非洲国家占12个。——摘编自张岂之《中国历史新编》材料三：1971年4月，周恩来根据毛泽东的决策，指示有关部门主动邀请美国乒乓球队访华，随后又亲自会见他们。“乒乓外交”被国际舆论称为“小球转动了大球”。——摘编自《中国近现代史纲要》", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2018年上半年教师资格证考试《初中历史》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "f68ca3d49b6ccc5a0ca80df5a2f2a3fc37500a3dcd78ab8d1b6e47bb93cddb65", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2644, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2873, "next_source_question_number": 29, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2018年上半年教师资格证考试《初中历史》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 25, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "f68ca3d49b6ccc5a0ca80df5a2f2a3fc37500a3dcd78ab8d1b6e47bb93cddb65"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.lishi.2018a.q25"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.lishi.s1.k01", "ntce.chuzhong.lishi.s1.k05", "ntce.chuzhong.lishi.s1.k10"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.ability.subject"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.310.r001"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.chuzhong.lishi.2018a.q25"], "word_count": 229, "level": "chuzhong", "subject": "lishi", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/初中真题/2018年上半年教师资格证考试《初中历史》题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2018年上半年教师资格证考试《初中历史》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "f68ca3d49b6ccc5a0ca80df5a2f2a3fc37500a3dcd78ab8d1b6e47bb93cddb65", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2644, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2873, "next_source_question_number": 29, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2018年上半年教师资格证考试《初中历史》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 25, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "f68ca3d4